invalid type: string "6. ENGINEERING INFRASTRUCTURE BUDGET\n\nThe FY2026 Engineering budget is $800,000.\n\nThe approved allocation is:\n\nCloud infrastructure and developer platforms: $360,000.\n\nDevelopment tools and external specialists: $240,000.\n\nSecurity and reliability improvements: $120,000.\n\nTraining and technical certification: $80,000.\n\nTotal: $800,000.\n\ns\n\nPuÿYVÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ